<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title> Your OnWard Education Account is Ready !</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f7f7f7;
        }

        .container {
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top-left-radius: 8px;
            border-top-right-radius: 8px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .signature {
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .font_italic {
            font-style: italic !important;
        }

        .name_header {
            font-style: italic !important;
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .second-line {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .keyword {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .teamName {
            margin-top: -12px;
        }

        .button-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .Divider {
            height: 2px;
            margin: 29.5px 0 29px 1px;
            padding: 1px 0;
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
        }

        .Line-1 {
            height: 2px;
            margin: 30px 0 0px 0px;
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
        }

        .finishingLine1 {
            margin-top: 29px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .finishingLine2 {
            margin-top: -7px;
            margin-left: -5px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="content">
            <div class="Line-1"></div>
            <p>
            <div class="name_header signature">
                Hello,
            </div>
            </p>

            <p class="font_italic">Thank you for your institutional subscription to OnWard Education! We’re delighted to let you know that your institution has been officially added to our platform.</p>
            <p class="second-line font_italic">You can visit the college admin web portal at <a href="https://onward-admin.com" class="keyword">https://onward-admin.com</a>.</p>
            <p class="second-line font_italic">Your log-in details are below:<br /></p>
            <p class="second-line font_italic">
                Email: <span class="signature keyword">{{email}}</span><br />
                Password: <span class="signature keyword">{{password}}</span>
            </p>

            <p class="font_italic">If you need any help or have questions, just reach out to us at <a href="mailto:hello@onward.ie" class="keyword">hello@onward.ie</a>. We’re always happy to help.</p>
            <p class="signature">Welcome to OnWard!</p>
            <div class="Divider"></div>

        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>